OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fand cloudy evening, but a band of
OL,7,Fheavy rain reaches the southwest
OL,8,Faround midnight, spreading east
OL,9,Fovernight. Strong southeasterly winds
OL,10,Fbring coastal gales or severe gales in
OL,11,Fwest.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FCloudy with heavy rain
OL,14,Fclearing eastwards through the
OL,15,Fmorning. This leaves a largely dry
OL,16,Fafternoon with sunny spells
OL,17,Fdeveloping, but also a few showers.
OL,18,FStrong winds easing through the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
